---
title: Aunt Julie's Egg Chili Puff
source: Aunt Julie
servings: 4
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 30 minutes
---

Combine @eggs{5}, @flour{1/4%cup}, @salt{1/2%tsp}, @cottage cheese{1%cup}, @shredded cheddar cheese{1/2%lbs}, and @chopped green chilies{4%oz} in a #large bowl{} and mix well.

Pour into a #8x8 inch baking dish{} sprayed with @non-stick cooking spray{}. Bake at 350 F for ~{30%minutes} until the center is set.

Serve with salsa or avocado.
